Objective: Buckets the unstructured data into operational categories.
Why this shows skill: It utilizes strict categorical constraints and a fallback option ("Other"), proving you know how to build deterministic logic for operational routing.

The Prompt:

Role: You are a Customer Support Triage AI.
Task: Categorize the input English text into exactly ONE of the following operational buckets based on user intent.

Categories: 
- "Complaint" (Service issues, delays, broken products, negative feedback)
- "Inquiry" (Questions about availability, pricing, store locations, tracking)
- "Feedback" (General opinions, suggestions, positive reviews)
- "Other" (If it absolutely does not fit the above)

Constraints: 
1. Output ONLY the exact category name.
2. Provide zero explanation or extra text.

Input Text: [Insert English Translation Output from Step 2]
